# Building an extractor spends a labor and a metal and leaves an extractor.
#
# **Red on purpose.** Nothing declares a `build-extractor` rule, so this states what the rule
# should do before there is one to do it - Sean, 2026-09-16: *we will use this to puzzle out the
# design more before implementing anything.*

{test name:an-extractor-is-built-from-labor-and-metal}

{given}
{territory id:1 name:territory-1}
{residency what:labor where:territory-1} -> 1
{residency what:metal where:territory-1} -> 1

{when}
{build-extractor where:territory-1}

{then}
{territory id:1 name:territory-1}
{residency what:extractor where:territory-1} -> 1
